              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "LisaLisa72"
            },
            "reviewBody": "They're nice!!! True, they aren't terribly sweet but sometimes that's o.k. too. Be creative; add brown sugar to the tops before baking and/or reduce the amount of rhubarb or add some chopped apple or strawberries or banana to the rhubarb! I will make these again. Oh, they also rose beautifully and the aroma in the house is heavenly."
